  "notes": "Implemented adapter-side provider_auth.mode runtime enforcement. Created resolveAuthMode() pure function in src/core/provider-auth-resolver.ts — enforces configured mode (api_key/subscription/auto) against runtime-detected state, throws ProviderError on conflict with doctor hint. All 3 adapters updated: GeminiAdapter adds detectNormalizedAuthMode() (normalizes oauth/vertex/cloud_shell → subscription), CodexAdapter reuses existing detectAuthMode(), ClaudeAdapter adds detectAuthMode() (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY → api_key, else → subscription). Enforcement is gated on authConfig !== undefined for full backward compatibility — 381 existing provider tests pass unchanged. New tests: 27/27 pass covering all 6 required scenarios plus edge cases. tsc --noEmit clean. Remaining test failures (9 across 5 test files) are pre-existing or caused by other sprint-155 tasks (Task 3's model-registry-refresh.ts violates error-handling-unification test, doctor-checks count changed by Task 3). Proof: grep -n resolveAuthMode src/providers/*.ts → 3 adapters calling it.",
